<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body>
    <table style="width: 100%; float: left; border: 5px solid #0000000d; padding: 0px 10px;" border="0">
      
      <tr>
        <td>
          <img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_HEADER}}" style="width: 100%;">
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>

          <p>Dear {{name}},</p>
          <p></p>

          <p>
            This is a gentle reminder that your loan is running with {{company_name_show}} 
            which is due on <strong>{{repayDate}}</strong>.
            We request you to kindly make your loan repayment on the due date.
            Also, after making the payment on time, you can apply for the re-loan which can be 
            disbursed within 30 minutes.
          </p>

          <p>
            We appreciate our customers and we would like to serve you again.
          </p>

          <p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>

          <p>Best regards,</p>
          <p>Thanks</p>
          <p>Team {{company_name_show}}</p>

        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>
          <img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_FOOTER}}" style="width: 100%;">
        </td>
      </tr>

    </table>
  </body>
</html>
